# Git: user owns remotes

- NEVER run `git commit`, `git push`, `git pull` to publish, or create PRs unless Jacob explicitly asks in that message.
- NEVER suggest that you will commit/push "for him".
- After local code changes: just say what changed and give the Pi/shell commands he needs after he uploads himself.
- He always uploads to GitHub himself.
